      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIN CITY BANDIT (6) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 42.15 beating Whiskey Grace. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well at this distance. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Great chance to get the job done again. RAYMAR SHAME (2) has found the minor placings here at last couple of runs, finishing third last time beaten 3.5 lengths (29.75). Suited by the extra trip here. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Expected to feature. NO SHAME (1) turned in a solid run last start over 622m at Richmond finishing 5th and beaten only 2.5 lengths (36.27). Has placed a couple of times at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Should be in this for a long way. STILTON SHINE (5) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
